  "title": "Tim Perry&#39;s Soup (Creamy Curry Cauliflower and Broccoli Soup)",
  "description": "A simple curry soup that will not disappoint neither with its flavor, nor with its simplicity of preparation. Broccoli and cauliflower serve as the main components of this one-pot wonder. Serve with crusty bread and butter.",
